<p>A navigation menu component with dropdown functionality and mobile-responsive design.</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Implementation note:</strong> Unlike other React components in this library, <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">Megamenu</span></span></code></span> is provided as a template and is not a ready-to-use component. Its markup and styling demonstrate the intended structure and visual design. Vendors must implement and connect the required navigation logic, mobile panels, search, links, and other interactions, within their own application.</p>
</blockquote>
