<h2 class="bold" id="standalone-usage"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="mega-menu#standalone-usage">Standalone Usage</a></h2>
<p>The Megamenu component is built as a standalone JavaScript bundle that automatically initializes all elements with the <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">data-megamenu</span></span></code></span> attribute.</p>
<h3 class="bold" id="build-files"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="mega-menu#build-files">Build Files</a></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>CSS</strong>: <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">build/lib/megamenu.css</span></span></code></span></li>
<li><strong>JavaScript</strong>: <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">build/lib/megamenu.js</span></span></code></span></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="bold" id="quick-start"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="mega-menu#quick-start">Quick Start</a></h3>
<ol>
<li>
